+ * 1.3.2, priv_include/disp_init_data_st7121.h (Apache-2.0 source table,
+ * SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD).
+ * Keep these controller-specific values separate from ST7123's sequence.
+ */
